  "description": {
    "raw": "You grow flesh on a decomposed or skeletonized corpse of a Medium or smaller creature, providing it with sufficient flesh that it can be animated as a zombie rather than a skeleton. The corpse looks as it did when the creature died. The new flesh is somewhat rotted and not fit for eating.",
    "search_text": "\"you grow flesh on a decomposed or skeletonized corpse of a medium or smaller creature, providing it with sufficient flesh that it can be animated as a zombie rather than a skeleton. the corpse looks as it did when the creature died. the new flesh is somewhat rotted and not fit for eating.\"",
